@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@playerA = some-person
@playerB = egor-gulyakin

### 01. Проверка запуска: status = ok, connected_replicas = 2
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 02. Создать профиль SomePerson: level = 5, в ответе есть created_at
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/players/{{playerA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "SomePerson", "level": 5, "region": "EU"}

### 03. Создать профиль EgorGulyakin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/players/{{playerB}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "EgorGulyakin", "level": 3, "region": "US"}

### 04. Первое чтение SomePerson: в заголовках ответа X-Cache: MISS
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/players/{{playerA}}

### 05. Повторное чтение в течение 60 секунд: X-Cache: HIT
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/players/{{playerA}}

### 06. Поднять уровень на 2: level = 7, кеш удалён, уведомление отправлено
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/players/{{playerA}}/level
Content-Type: application/json

{"delta": 2}

### 07. Чтение после изменения: level = 7, X-Cache: MISS
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/players/{{playerA}}

### 08. Первый вход нового игрока: count = 1, ttl около 86400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/players/{{playerA}}/login

### 09. Второй вход: count = 2, TTL не продлевается
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/players/{{playerA}}/login

### 10. Начислить SomePerson 100 очков
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/leaderboard/score
Content-Type: application/json

{"player_id": "{{playerA}}", "score": 100}

### 11. Начислить EgorGulyakin 200 очков
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/leaderboard/score
Content-Type: application/json

{"player_id": "{{playerB}}", "score": 200}

### 12. Прибавить SomePerson ещё 50 очков: для нового игрока итог 150
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/leaderboard/score
Content-Type: application/json

{"player_id": "{{playerA}}", "score": 50}

### 13. Топ-10 по убыванию очков: EgorGulyakin выше SomePerson
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/leaderboard/top?limit=10

### 14. Место SomePerson: rank с 1 по убыванию, redis_rank с 0 по возрастанию (ZRANK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/leaderboard/rank/{{playerA}}

### 15. Добавить SomePerson достижение winner: added = true
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/players/{{playerA}}/achievements
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "winner"}

### 16. Добавить SomePerson второе достижение veteran
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/players/{{playerA}}/achievements
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "veteran"}

### 17. Добавить EgorGulyakin достижение winner
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/players/{{playerB}}/achievements
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "winner"}

### 18. Повторно добавить winner для SomePerson: added = false, дубликата нет
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/players/{{playerA}}/achievements
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "winner"}

### 19. Проверить достижение SomePerson: has_achievement = true
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/players/{{playerA}}/achievements/winner

### 20. Общие достижения SomePerson и EgorGulyakin: achievements = ["winner"]
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/players/{{playerA}}/achievements/common/{{playerB}}

### 21. Pipeline: создать 20 профилей, в ответе count = 20 и elapsed_ms
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/players/batch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "players": [
    {"id": "{{playerA}}-batch-01", "name": "Player 01", "level": 1, "region": "EU"},
    {"id": "{{playerA}}-batch-02", "name": "Player 02", "level": 2, "region": "EU"},
    {"id": "{{playerA}}-batch-03", "name": "Player 03", "level": 3, "region": "US"},
    {"id": "{{playerA}}-batch-04", "name": "Player 04", "level": 4, "region": "US"},
    {"id": "{{playerA}}-batch-05", "name": "Player 05", "level": 5, "region": "EU"},
    {"id": "{{playerA}}-batch-06", "name": "Player 06", "level": 6, "region": "EU"},
    {"id": "{{playerA}}-batch-07", "name": "Player 07", "level": 7, "region": "US"},
    {"id": "{{playerA}}-batch-08", "name": "Player 08", "level": 8, "region": "US"},
    {"id": "{{playerA}}-batch-09", "name": "Player 09", "level": 9, "region": "EU"},
    {"id": "{{playerA}}-batch-10", "name": "Player 10", "level": 10, "region": "EU"},
    {"id": "{{playerA}}-batch-11", "name": "Player 11", "level": 1, "region": "US"},
    {"id": "{{playerA}}-batch-12", "name": "Player 12", "level": 2, "region": "US"},
    {"id": "{{playerA}}-batch-13", "name": "Player 13", "level": 3, "region": "EU"},
    {"id": "{{playerA}}-batch-14", "name": "Player 14", "level": 4, "region": "EU"},
    {"id": "{{playerA}}-batch-15", "name": "Player 15", "level": 5, "region": "US"},
    {"id": "{{playerA}}-batch-16", "name": "Player 16", "level": 6, "region": "US"},
    {"id": "{{playerA}}-batch-17", "name": "Player 17", "level": 7, "region": "EU"},
    {"id": "{{playerA}}-batch-18", "name": "Player 18", "level": 8, "region": "EU"},
    {"id": "{{playerA}}-batch-19", "name": "Player 19", "level": 9, "region": "US"},
    {"id": "{{playerA}}-batch-20", "name": "Player 20", "level": 10, "region": "US"}
  ]
}

### 22. Проверка записи при failover и паузе реплик
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/players/{{playerA}}-ha
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Failover check", "level": 1, "region": "EU"}

### 23. Проверка восстановления: новый master, connected_replicas = 2
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
